abstract: >-
  A scratch-trained 1.1B English language model on 20B prediction tokens using
  one NVIDIA L20, with frozen same-protocol small-model comparisons and
  separately reported multimodal adaptation experiments. This citation names
  a software repository, not a peer-reviewed paper or a new model release.
